      "why_it_matters": "AI in QA",
      "summary": "Frank Portman discusses the limitations of using large language models (LLMs) for intent prediction, arguing that their inductive bias is not suitable for forecasting human behavior. Instead, he advocates for a combination of transformers and graph neural networks to create a more effective 'foundation model of behavior' for decision-making in various applications.",
