      "summary": "The introduction of SnortML represents a significant evolution in intrusion detection systems by integrating machine learning to enhance detection capabilities. This shift from traditional signature-based detection to context-aware analysis allows for quicker responses to novel threats, addressing the inherent gaps in existing systems. By running both machine learning and signature evaluation in parallel, organizations can achieve a more robust security posture.",
